PRINTFORML A tsukumogami transformed from a taiko drum.
PRINTFORML Initially supported by the power of the Miracle Mallet, she later learned how to borrow the "magic energy" of
PRINTFORML modern drummers from the Outside World, which is why she uses a modern drum set.
PRINTFORML Above all, Raiko values freedom, which she uses to make some noise at concerts and to create
PRINTFORML a world where tools can live freely without being used and abused incessantly.
PRINTFORML She has a nurturing and shrewd side to her, using mass media to promote live performances and
PRINTFORML teach other tsukumogami methods of connecting their magic energy to the Outside World.
PRINTFORML As of now, Raiko Horikawa is a member of the Prismriver Sisters band, the first member outside of the Prismriver family.
RETURN 1